    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a glorious civilization, the Rune World was plunged into chaos by the &quot;Core of Chaos&quot; going berserk. As the last inheritor of the runes, you must survive the relentless tides of monsters that emerge with each passing day and night. Every battle is a new trial of runes\u2014whether it\u2019s extracting ancient runes from the bodies of colossal bosses or assembling the ultimate weapon capable of sealing the Chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/af4b2cfe6e2cca7a73c877319d3fccf5.poster.avif?t=1752716138\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/af4b2cfe6e2cca7a73c877319d3fccf5.webm?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/af4b2cfe6e2cca7a73c877319d3fccf5.mp4?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Items: Choose from hundreds of unique runes and weapons, each with their own distinct traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeform Builds: The selection and arrangement of your runes will shape the form and attributes of your weapon\u2019s output.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure Chests &amp; Shops: Elite monsters and bosses drop powerful chests, while shops serve as a vital source for runes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Events &amp; Objectives: Encounter a variety of special events and objectives throughout the game, each offering rich rewards upon completion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Dynamic Trajectory System \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morph projectiles in real-time with runes, craft signature ballistics by combining trajectory modifiers with effect-enhancing glyphs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/2d5fda0a03fd4590564919db0ba21fbc.poster.avif?t=1752716138\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/2d5fda0a03fd4590564919db0ba21fbc.webm?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/2d5fda0a03fd4590564919db0ba21fbc.mp4?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Elemental Alchemy Engine \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master four primal elements (Fire/Ice/Poison/Lightning), trigger devastating chain reactions through elemental synergies to unlock weapon's true potential</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/90823b5b40f05fe6aab332a5a9724264.poster.avif?t=1752716138\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/90823b5b40f05fe6aab332a5a9724264.webm?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/90823b5b40f05fe6aab332a5a9724264.mp4?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Rogue-Lite Challenges \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly triggered bullet hell survival, elite trials and boss rushes - survive to claim epic loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/fbe0151b3bd9749f9fa8e4c230ffef62.poster.avif?t=1752716138\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/fbe0151b3bd9749f9fa8e4c230ffef62.webm?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/fbe0151b3bd9749f9fa8e4c230ffef62.mp4?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Progressive Questlines \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic bounty system with time-limited purges, relic hunts and stronghold assaults - complete milestones to unlock legendary armory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/de50a9da469e0e627f93f26b1b0701d3.poster.avif?t=1752716138\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/de50a9da469e0e627f93f26b1b0701d3.webm?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/de50a9da469e0e627f93f26b1b0701d3.mp4?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Modular Rune Matrix \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft unique combat builds with 100+ modular runes - every run delivers fresh tactical possibilities through endless combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/3909f5d3a5e1d4479aa57830f19d4d5e.poster.avif?t=1752716138\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/3909f5d3a5e1d4479aa57830f19d4d5e.webm?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/3909f5d3a5e1d4479aa57830f19d4d5e.mp4?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a glorious civilization, the Rune World was plunged into chaos by the &quot;Core of Chaos&quot; going berserk. As the last inheritor of the runes, you must survive the relentless tides of monsters that emerge with each passing day and night. Every battle is a new trial of runes\u2014whether it\u2019s extracting ancient runes from the bodies of colossal bosses or assembling the ultimate weapon capable of sealing the Chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/af4b2cfe6e2cca7a73c877319d3fccf5.poster.avif?t=1752716138\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/af4b2cfe6e2cca7a73c877319d3fccf5.webm?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/af4b2cfe6e2cca7a73c877319d3fccf5.mp4?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Items: Choose from hundreds of unique runes and weapons, each with their own distinct traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeform Builds: The selection and arrangement of your runes will shape the form and attributes of your weapon\u2019s output.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure Chests &amp; Shops: Elite monsters and bosses drop powerful chests, while shops serve as a vital source for runes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Events &amp; Objectives: Encounter a variety of special events and objectives throughout the game, each offering rich rewards upon completion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Dynamic Trajectory System 