 claim epic loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/fbe0151b3bd9749f9fa8e4c230ffef62.poster.avif?t=1752716138\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/fbe0151b3bd9749f9fa8e4c230ffef62.webm?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/fbe0151b3bd9749f9fa8e4c230ffef62.mp4?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Progressive Questlines \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic bounty system with time-limited purges, relic hunts and stronghold assaults - complete milestones to unlock legendary armory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/de50a9da469e0e627f93f26b1b0701d3.poster.avif?t=1752716138\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/de50a9da469e0e627f93f26b1b0701d3.webm?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521130/extras/de50a9da469e0e627f93f26b1b0701d3.mp4?t=1752716138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Modular Rune Matrix \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft unique combat builds with 100+ modular runes - every run delivers fresh tactical possibilities through endless combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akam